Purpose: AWS Serverless Application Model (SAM) CLI builds, validates, tests, and deploys serverless applications described in SAM templates.
Install AWS SAM CLI using the official instructions for your operating system. Install AWS CLI first.
Open a new terminal and run the version and help checks.
sam --version
sam validate --help
Verification test: sam --version prints a version; sam validate --help displays usage information.
